(7563342, 1212372, 59029, '<td valign="top">OMG...NO.  You never, ever, EVER do Tree pose with the foot on the inside of the knee. On the outside of the ankle, or the outside calf, or inner thigh, yes. But NEVER on the knee, unless you want to risk dislocating it. As a yoga teacher in training, I do know what I''m talking about.</td>', 'OMG...NO.  You never, ever, EVER do Tree pose with the foot on the inside of the knee. On the outside of the ankle, or the outside calf, or inner thigh, yes. But NEVER on the knee, unless you want to risk dislocating it. As a yoga teacher in training, I do know what I''m talking about.', '2018-03-20 13:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
